{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113689","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113689/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113689/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113689/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113689","id":3702146558,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7cqkX-","number":113689,"title":"FontFile glyph setup methods not exposed to C# API","user":{"login":"BenMcLean","id":1747250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDcyNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1747250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean","html_url":"https://github.com/BenMcLean","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-12-06T18:17:50Z","updated_at":"2025-12-07T06:54:03Z","closed_at":"2025-12-07T05:47:59Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.1 stable mono\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11, .NET 8.0\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `FontFile` class has methods for programmatically setting up bitmap fonts that work in GDScript but are not exposed to the C# API:\n\n- `set_glyph_uv_rect()`\n- `set_glyph_advance()` (possibly others)\n\nThese methods are documented and work in GDScript, but attempting to call them from C# results in:\nerror CS1061: 'FontFile' does not contain a definition for 'SetGlyphUvRect'\n\nThis prevents C# users from programmatically creating bitmap fonts at runtime, which was possible in Godot 3 using\n`BitmapFont.AddChar()`.\n\n### Workaround\nI'm attempting to embed some inline gdscript in my C# for now but this still needs to be fixed.\n\n### Related\n- Migration from Godot 3 BitmapFont to Godot 4 FontFile\n- Issue #72754 documents the GDScript usage\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a C# Godot project\n2. Try to call `fontFile.SetGlyphUvRect(0, new Vector2I(16, 0), 65, new Rect2(...))`\n3. Compilation fails\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI'll make one if necessary but the issue seems pretty self-explanatory.","closed_by":{"login":"BenMcLean","id":1747250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDcyNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1747250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean","html_url":"https://github.com/BenMcLean","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BenMcLean/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113689/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113689/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}